					"documentation": "##SHOW CART FLOW OF EVENTS\n\n#BASIC FLOW\n\n1. *Buyer* saskia erakusteko botoia sakatu.\n2. *Sistemak* **cart** barruko **sale** guztiak erakutsi.\n3. *Sistemsk* kostu totala erakutsi.\n4. *Buyer* **cart** erosi nahi badu extends **buy cart**.\n5. *Buyer* **cart** etik **sale** bat kendu nahi badu extends **Remove from cart**.\n#ALTERNATIVE FLOW\n\n1. Ez dago **sale** rik **cart** barruan."
				},
